# The admin accepts an advance to the current target.
MODULE: AdvanceStrictEqualAccepted
TARGET: AdvanceStrict
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the monotonic check admits an equal target
PERTURBS: Advance

--- FIND
    /\ IF cfg # NoCfg /\ TargetValid(t) /\ t > cfg
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF cfg # NoCfg /\ TargetValid(t) /\ t >= cfg
--- END